          "short": "$12-5\\sqrt{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(7+\\sqrt{2})(2-\\sqrt{2})&=14-7\\sqrt{2}+2\\sqrt{2}-2\\\\(7+\\sqrt{2})(2-\\sqrt{2})&=12-5\\sqrt{2}\\end{align*}$$",
