        "answer": {
          "short": "$2-5\\sqrt{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3-2\\sqrt{5})(4+\\sqrt{5})&=12+3\\sqrt{5}-8\\sqrt{5}-10\\\\(3-2\\sqrt{5})(4+\\sqrt{5})&=2-5\\sqrt{5}\\end{align*}$$",
